    "title": "Letter: 'No Kings' column misses the mark - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Jackson County Pilot\nwebsite\nJackson\nLetter: ‘No Kings’ column misses the mark\nBy Jackson County Pilot Staff,\n17 hours agoI generally stay out of political conversations, as I have been a centrist my whole life, and see merits on both sides. However, I cannot remain silent after reading Mike Jordan’s June 19 column regarding the “No Kings” protests. I know many who participated in the protests a few weeks ago, and the reason for the protests was to object to the authoritarianism of the current administration. There are very good reasons for the checks and balances our Founding Fathers put into the Constitution.",
